{"data": {"event": {"id": "8e992b96-1db9-46d5-a9b4-b95c23d2dc8e", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Radiologie cardiaque pour tous", "start": "2026-10-10T16:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T17:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 100, 100); background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\">Lors de cette s\u00e9ance, le Dr Thomas Martinelli remettra la m\u00e9daille d'honneur au Dr Anne Liesse</span></p>", "<p>&nbsp;</p>", "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les principaux diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels de la cardiomyopathie hypertrophique en IRM cardiaque</strong> et reconna\u00eetre les principaux pi\u00e8ges d\u2019interpr\u00e9tation.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les sp\u00e9cificit\u00e9s de l\u2019imagerie cardiaque chez la femme</strong> et prendre en compte les particularit\u00e9s li\u00e9es au stress et \u00e0 la tol\u00e9rance des examens d\u2019IRM cardiaque.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les aspects normaux et pathologiques des dispositifs cardiaques implantables en IRM</strong>, afin d\u2019am\u00e9liorer leur interpr\u00e9tation et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de l\u2019examen.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "12ce8395-2cd0-409b-937e-fb761e888ff4", "name": "253", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "ad7f2aa5-6585-4b81-8295-d302f6fe88a2", "title": "Remise de la m\u00e9daille d'honneur", "start": "2026-10-10T16:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T16:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "87680015-05d3-4bd8-ae30-bb98e227f1ac", "lastName": "Martinelli", "firstName": "Thomas", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Valence